{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108480","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108480","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710848001:1":{"text":"ようやく、すべてが終わりました。","source_cn":"一切终于结束了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF011E2BDCD46452E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ようやく、すべてが終わりました。","female":"ようやく、すべてが終わりました。","variant_male_record_index":"226120","variant_female_record_index":"226121","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710848002:1":{"text":"あなたがいなければ、王宮も古聖堂も、どうなっていたことか……","source_cn":"王宫和圣古堂……如果不是您，后果不堪设想。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x137BF5D07ED72B5F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたがいなければ、王宮も古聖堂も、どうなっていたことか……","female":"あなたがいなければ、王宮も古聖堂も、どうなっていたことか……","variant_male_record_index":"226122","variant_female_record_index":"226123","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710848003:1":{"text":"守備軍とサバンナの民を代表して、あなたのご協力に感謝いたします。","source_cn":"我谨代表守备军，和赛凡纳的所有民众，感谢您的帮助。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84E2611195B8BA44","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"守備軍とサバンナの民を代表して、あなたのご協力に感謝いたします。","female":"守備軍とサバンナの民を代表して、あなたのご協力に感謝いたします。","variant_male_record_index":"226124","variant_female_record_index":"226125","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1710848003":{"text":"守備軍とサバンナの民を代表して、あなたのご協力に感謝いたします。","source_cn":"我谨代表守备军，和赛凡纳的所有民众，感谢您的帮助。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84E2611195B8BA44","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"守備軍とサバンナの民を代表して、あなたのご協力に感謝いたします。","female":"守備軍とサバンナの民を代表して、あなたのご協力に感謝いたします。","variant_male_record_index":"226124","variant_female_record_index":"226125","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710848004:1":{"text":"今後の復興と救済、そしてディアグレス一派の処分は、行政部と内務部が引き継ぐでしょう。","source_cn":"后续的重建、抚恤，以及对迪尔格雷党羽的清算，行政部和内...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x32381F8D62A33459","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"今後の復興と救済、そしてディアグレス一派の処分は、行政部と内務部が引き継ぐでしょう。","female":"今後の復興と救済、そしてディアグレス一派の処分は、行政部と内務部が引き継ぐでしょう。","variant_male_record_index":"226126","variant_female_record_index":"226127","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710848005:1":{"text":"我ら守備軍の仕事もここまでです。","source_cn":"我们守备军的职责已经完成了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F54BA80F5ACAC7F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我ら守備軍の仕事もここまでです。","female":"我ら守備軍の仕事もここまでです。","variant_male_record_index":"226128","variant_female_record_index":"226129","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710848006:1":{"text":"グウィネス。","source_cn":"格温妮丝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BEF23AB4B76FDCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710848007:1":{"text":"はっ！指揮官！","source_cn":"是！司令！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89CFE63DD2933C2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710848008:1":{"text":"今日はよくやった。指示も的確で、実に勇敢な戦いぶりだった。","source_cn":"你今天做得很好。指挥果断，作战勇猛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39A5E72F504009D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710848009:1":{"text":"……成長したな。第一部隊小隊長の名に恥じない働きだったぞ。","source_cn":"你成长了，第一分队队长的名号，你当之无愧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EDDC45E88C3CE11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710848010:1":{"text":"やはり……テフラスキアの前線へ行かせるわけにはいかん。","source_cn":"所以……别再去想什么灰影郡前线了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD9395C1ADE049C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710848011:1":{"text":"えっ！？","source_cn":"什么？！<key:dialog37>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE9622A387DF8967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710848012:1":{"text":"サバンナに残れ。ここでも、お前の実力は十分発揮できる。","source_cn":"留在赛凡纳。在这里，你也能继续发挥自己的长处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA5573B6E25E54DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710848013:1":{"text":"実力……引き続き、守備軍のマスコットを務めることですか？お父……指揮官！私が求めているのは、真に戦える場所です！","source_cn":"发挥长处？继续当那个挂名的“第一分队”吉祥物吗？ 父…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA72ACF5DC5A44C12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1710848014:1":{"text":"マスコットなどではない。","source_cn":"不。不是吉祥物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6595D80C6B2EBA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710848015:1":{"text":"今後は、守備軍の中核を担う役職をお前に任せる。","source_cn":"是真正承担起守备军的核心职责。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x075F676F0C801DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710848016:1":{"text":"今日の一件で、王都の防衛体制の脆さが露呈した。守備軍は徹底的に立て直す必要がある。","source_cn":"今日一事暴露了王都防务的空虚，守备军需要彻底重整。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B63AB0DAE19BFB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710848017:1":{"text":"お前には、ここに残って私を補佐してほしい。","source_cn":"我要你留下来，帮我。但是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCD0A21B6CDBF94C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710848018:1":{"text":"もちろん楽な仕事ではない。覚悟はしておけよ。","source_cn":"这可不是什么轻松的差事。你不要嫌苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14A015EB24599BF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710848019:1":{"text":"防衛体制の立て直し、ですか……","source_cn":"哼……重整防务？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1874FF94A751D82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710848020:1":{"text":"正式な任命をいただけたら、考えてもいいですよ……！","source_cn":"我考虑考虑！你先给我正式的任命再说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x611DD6D47DAA5C51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1710848021:1":{"text":"ふっ、なら急いで妃殿下にお伺いを立てんとな。","source_cn":"我会立刻向王后陛下请命的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B05A6AEFD2A4C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710848022:1":{"text":"任せて！","source_cn":"这个包在我身上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E4A40EAD9BD7223","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710848023:1":{"text":"私が母上を説得するわ！グウィネスはこんなに頑張ったんだもの、王都に残るのは当然よ！","source_cn":"我一定会让母后同意的！格温妮丝今天这么厉害，她留下是理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D599EEB7A8407C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710848024:1":{"text":"私はこの後、王宮へ赴き、妃殿下に此度の戦いの顛末をご報告する。","source_cn":"我稍后要去王宫，向王后陛下汇报此次战役的全部经过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EF236D61D402995","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_femal